      "text": "论行小运法",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c056:p0002",
      "sha256": "8a5899816ce7f26c3f0f0d58d9042282c6b1dc3d2a1a8f3494b53ab838cad13b"
    },
    {
      "section": "论行小运法",
      "text": "凡小运不问阴阳二命，男一岁起丙寅，二岁丁卯顺行。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c056:p0003",
      "sha256": "9ea6f0f1253b1472d54b18d1ef0d4a2750b09883f3ed10f3705682fc9fd14e16"
    },
    {
      "section": "论行小运法",
      "text": "截法：十一丙子二十一丙戌，周而复始。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c056:p0004",
      "sha256": "ceff32dd231c4ab2adad8839ca8df9cbb077fad7fecaf9b707ed9c5d1b771783"
    },
    {
      "section": "论行小运法",
      "text": "女一岁起壬申，二岁辛未逆行。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c056:p0005",
      "sha256": "3a54096bbca468fefa6e6997320e24095c74985081fce8d1a2cf95e4333e5de6"
    },
    {
      "section": "论行小运法",
      "text": "截法：一岁壬申，十一壬戌，二十一壬子，周而复始。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c056:p0006",
      "sha256": "3085cde9bc774b86aaf625e6e052e5e4ba5f173d6dbadebfbecfa387bfe580f6"
    },
    {
      "section": "论行小运法",
      "text": "眉批：小运之法，男从丙寅方，取三阳之义，女从壬申，乃从三阴之喜。一年一岁，男顺女逆数，尽物甲从头又数。",
      "layer": "historical_commentary",
